// 本文件源码取自同一游戏的源码版（033-2 longyunmeng），用 v22pre11 编译器重新编译，与本版的 .b 二进制完全一致。
// Source taken from the source edition of this game (033-2); it compiles to the same program as this edition's .b binary.
//yijing3.c
inherit ITEM;
inherit F_UNIQUE;
#include <ansi.h>
 
void create()
{
        set_name(HIY"「易经系辞篇」"NOR, ({ "yijing xici","yijing3", }));
        set_weight(500);
        if( clonep() )
                set_default_object(__FILE__);
        else {
                set("unit", "本");
                set("long",
        "这是一本用薄绢写成的书。上书：“易经系辞篇”。\n"
        "书皮泛黄，看来已经保存很久了。\n",

        );
                set("value", 0);
                set("material", "silk");
                set("skill", ([
                        "name":       "qimen-wuxing",
                        "jing_cost":  35,
                        "difficulty": 20,
                        "max_skill":  100,
                        "min_skill":  75
                ]) );
        }
}
